{
  "_comment": [
    "Android App Links for RiftCompare. Publish this at",
    "https://riftcompare.com/.well-known/assetlinks.json — in this repo that",
    "means public/.well-known/assetlinks.json, which Next.js serves as a static",
    "file. It must be served over HTTPS, as application/json, with NO redirect.",
    "",
    "What it does: AndroidManifest.xml declares an intent-filter with",
    "android:autoVerify=\"true\" for riftcompare.com. At install time Android",
    "fetches this file and checks that the installed app's signing certificate",
    "is listed below. If it matches, every riftcompare.com link on the phone",
    "opens directly in the app with no 'open with' chooser. If it does not, the",
    "app still works — links simply keep opening in the browser.",
    "",
    "!! WHICH FINGERPRINT !! With Play App Signing enabled (the default, and",
    "recommended), Google re-signs your upload with ITS OWN key, so the",
    "certificate on the installed app is NOT the one in your upload keystore.",
    "Using the upload fingerprint here is the single most common reason App",
    "Links silently fail to verify. Take the value from:",
    "",
    "  Play Console → your app → Test and release → Setup → App signing",
    "  → 'App signing key certificate' → SHA-256 certificate fingerprint",
    "",
    "For a locally-built debug/release APK (not via Play), get it with:",
    "",
    "  $ANDROID_HOME/build-tools/36.0.0/apksigner verify --print-certs app.apk",
    "",
    "You may list BOTH fingerprints in the array below — that is supported, and",
    "is what lets a locally sideloaded build and the Play build both verify.",
    "",
    "Delete this _comment key before publishing: Digital Asset Links tolerates",
    "it, but there is no reason to serve it.",
    "",
    "Verify once live:",
    "  curl -sS https://riftcompare.com/.well-known/assetlinks.json",
    "  adb shell pm verify-app-links --re-verify com.riftcompare.app",
    "  adb shell pm get-app-links com.riftcompare.app     (expect: verified)"
  ],
  "statements": [
    {
      "relation": ["delegate_permission/common.handle_all_urls"],
      "target": {
        "namespace": "android_app",
        "package_name": "com.riftcompare.app",
        "sha256_cert_fingerprints": [
          "REPLACE:WITH:THE:SHA256:FINGERPRINT:FROM:PLAY:APP:SIGNING"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
